- ## sedentary
+ ## sedentary

- - `sedentary.Bench.Plan#apply`, every overload of `sedentary.Bench.Plan#over`,
-   `sedentary.Stress#apply` and `sedentary.Profile#apply` gain a final type parameter
-   `topic <: Label`, and their parameter `suite: Testable` is now `suite: Testable of topic`.
-   Calls which pass no explicit type arguments are unaffected, given a contextual `Testable` with
-   a topic (see probably). (#2169)
